 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Jo and da",
   "texto": [
    "**Jo** usually presents something known, shared or in contrast to an expectation: **Det er jo sjovt!** may be equivalent to «But it's fun.» or «It's just fun.», depending on the context. **Da** expresses surprise or insistence: **Det er da fint!** = Well, it's okay!"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Vel and altså",
   "texto": [
    "**Vel** indicates assumption, with some doubt: **Han kommer vel snart.** = I suppose it will come soon. **Altså** means «that is» or «So...» and clarifies: **Det er altså ikke sandt.** = That is, it is not true."
   ]
  },
